{
  "_meta": {
    "about": "Quick start tier sets: a person picks a provider, pastes its API key, and gets a set named after the provider with that provider's CURRENT models on every tier. Served by captain_claw/flight_deck/tier_presets.py (GET /fd/tier-presets); the console's New tier set and the Library's setup wizard read it. A model release is an edit here, no frontend build. Keep model_prices.json in step when a model changes.",
    "checked": "2026-11-05",
    "key_prefixes": "How a pasted key names its provider: the form picks that provider, or says the key looks like another one. Leave it out when a provider's keys look like everyone else's (DeepSeek's plain sk-).",
    "recheck": "Monthly, and after any provider launch. Look at each provider's own model list (sources below), swap retired or superseded ids, keep input_ctx under the provider's long-prompt price step, and update 'checked'.",
    "sources": {
      "anthropic": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/overview",
      "openai": "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models",
      "gemini": "https://aistudio.google.com/docs/models",
      "xai": "https://docs.x.ai/docs/models",
      "deepseek": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing"
    },
    "notes": {
      "anthropic": "Haiku 5.5 costs 5x above 100k-token prompts, so its tiers read up to 100k.",
      "openai": "Long-context price above 272k input tokens; standard tiers stay at 256k. gpt-6-luna turns reasoning off on calls with tools (llm/__init__.py self-heals).",
      "gemini": "gemini-2.5-* retired 2026-10-20. Argon's introductory price ends 2026-12-01, 3.8 Flash's 2027-01-01.",
      "xai": "Prompts of 200k tokens or more cost more; grok-4.7 tiers read up to 160k. grok-4, grok-3 and grok-4-fast retired 2026-05-15.",
      "deepseek": "OpenAI-compatible endpoint. deepseek-flash (V4.1-Flash) takes images, deepseek-v4-pro does not, so the vision tier is on Flash with vision on. deepseek-v4-flash is a retired alias of deepseek-flash."
    }
  },
